+                Target: {created.target_value} · {created.type.replace("_", " ")}
+              </p>
+            </div>
+          </div>
+          <p className="mt-3 text-xs text-admin-muted">
+            Live now — kids will see this on their Challenges page (or their classroom's, if you scoped it to one).
